    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This suggests our can meet this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API type interfaces: Our platform's is designed with an API-first approach (REST + webhook), which directly addresses this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure within the EU: our offer a Sovereign tier hosting option through SecNumCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, the EU-only, and renewable-powered. a Sovereign tier hosting option meets The client hosting requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this is FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's hosting requirements, our propose an architecture that leverages our existing Atelier platform, hosted on SecNumCloud SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure within the EU. our existing Atelier platform will be configured to integrate with The client existing infrastructure through our API-first design and business tool integration capabilities. our will ensure that the performance metrics of Our platform's are optimized to meet the response time requirements for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict confidentiality obligations, GDPR compliance, and protection of sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures can we implement to ensure compliance with these requirements and maintain the reliability and traceability of outputs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance Officer at we, I can confirm that we has implemented various security measures to address the client's demands for strict confidentiality obligations, GDPR compliance, and protection of sensitive data.  we have achieved ISO 27001 certification, which demonstrates we commitment to information security management. we ISO 27001 scope includes development, delivery, and operations, ensuring that all aspects of we business are aligned with industry best practices for security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect data in transit, we use TLS 1.3 encryption, while data at rest is encrypted using AES-256." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we key management system is based on EU-based infrastructure, providing an extra layer of control over sensitive data. we also implement strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, along with access controls that prevent any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation is also used where relevant to further protect sensitive information. we GDPR compliance is supported by the appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO), maintenance of a data processing register, and adherence to GDPR Article 28 through we Data Processing Agreement (DPA)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of reliability and traceability of outputs, we have implemented role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging, which logs all system outputs and access to sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that any actions taken within we systems are trackable and can be monitored for compliance and security purposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud certification, which supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU. the SecNumCloud certification, which supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU ensures that client data is not only protected through we internal measures but also through the secure infrastructure provided by our hosting partner, OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these security measures, we can ensure compliance with the client's requirements for confidentiality, GDPR adherence, and sensitive data protection, while maintaining the reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with professional secrecy, confidentiality, and anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT), as well as adherence to industry standards and legal retention and archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with professional secrecy, confidentiality, and anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT)?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at Faber IA, we have experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, which suggests we are familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA is also up to date with Faber IA social and fiscal obligations, and we have administrative attestations available, indicating a level of compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT), our company context at Faber IA mentions that we monitor obligations related to the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT) as part of we regulatory compliance efforts. monitor implies we are aware of and likely have measures in place to comply with anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for industry standards, legal retention, and archival obligations, our company context at Faber IA does not provide specific details on how we comply with industry standards, legal retention, and archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company context at Faber IA mentions that we ensure the contractual framework does not compromise we professional obligations, which could include adherence to industry standards and legal requirements." ;
